/-!
# Stage P2 Over-Path Substages P2.1–P2.3

Proves `stageP2_over_sub1_to_3_kits_ext` and `stageP2_over_sub1_to_3_kits` (`+0x0868 → +0x0d5c` or
error exit to `s0.readReg64 .x30` via Arms 1–2) when `load_session` returned a populated 1-session
record whose current session misses (`PromoteMatchingMissAtProp`).
-/

public section

set_option autoImplicit false

attribute [-arm64_norm]
  CryptoVerification.SpqrV1.Kdf.HkdfToSliceProof.sp_sub_688_eq_hsp
  CryptoVerification.SpqrV1.Kdf.HkdfToSliceProof.sp_add_neg688_eq_hsp
